<!doctype html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Reward ex_novo - baseline MLP</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f7f8fb;
      --panel: #ffffff;
      --ink: #172033;
      --muted: #5d667a;
      --line: #d8dee9;
      --reward: #1f7a5b;
      --reward-soft: #dff3eb;
      --penalty: #b33c32;
      --penalty-soft: #f8e4e1;
      --post: #8a5a16;
      --post-soft: #fff0d6;
      --diag: #345995;
      --diag-soft: #e5ecfb;
      --disabled: #687083;
      --disabled-soft: #eceff4;
      --code: #eef2f7;
      --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(25, 31, 44, 0.08), 0 8px 24px rgba(25, 31, 44, 0.06);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--bg);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    header {
      padding: 28px clamp(18px, 4vw, 44px) 18px;
      background: #111827;
      color: #f9fafb;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #0b1020;
    }

    main {
      padding: 22px clamp(18px, 4vw, 44px) 40px;
      max-width: 1540px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    h1,
    h2,
    h3 {
      margin: 0;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 42px);
      font-weight: 760;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    h3 {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    p {
      margin: 8px 0;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .subhead {
      max-width: 980px;
      color: #c8d2e2;
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .badges,
    .stats,
    .filters {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .badges {
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 5px 9px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
      color: #eef4ff;
      font-size: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .section {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 18px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .formula-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .formula {
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #fbfcff;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .formula code {
      display: block;
      padding: 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: var(--code);
      color: #162032;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .flow {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(170px, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .flow-lane {
      min-width: 170px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #fbfcff;
      padding: 10px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .flow-lane:not(:last-child)::after {
      content: ">";
      position: absolute;
      right: -10px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      color: #8791a3;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: var(--bg);
      border-radius: 999px;
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 18px;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .flow-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 760;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #101828;
    }

    .chip {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 6px 0;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: #fff;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #263246;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .chip.reward {
      border-color: #9bd7c3;
      background: var(--reward-soft);
    }

    .chip.penalty {
      border-color: #e7b4ae;
      background: var(--penalty-soft);
    }

    .chip.post {
      border-color: #f1cf8f;
      background: var(--post-soft);
    }

    .chip.diag {
      border-color: #b9c8ea;
      background: var(--diag-soft);
    }

    .chip.disabled {
      border-color: #d2d7e1;
      background: var(--disabled-soft);
      color: var(--disabled);
    }

    .legend {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .legend .chip {
      display: inline-flex;
      width: auto;
      margin: 0;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 360px;
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .weights {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .weight-group {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 10px;
      background: #fbfcff;
    }

    .weight-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 4px 0;
      font-size: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid #eef1f6;
    }

    .weight-row:first-of-type {
      border-top: 0;
    }

    .weight-value {
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
      color: #182234;
    }

    .filters {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    input,
    select {
      min-height: 34px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--ink);
      font: inherit;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    input {
      min-width: min(360px, 100%);
      flex: 1 1 260px;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: separate;
      border-spacing: 0;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #fff;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    th,
    td {
      padding: 9px 10px;
      vertical-align: top;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #edf1f6;
      text-align: left;
    }

    th {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      background: #f0f4f9;
      color: #263246;
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    tbody tr:hover {
      background: #f8fafc;
    }

    .term-id {
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #111827;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 3px 7px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .pill.reward,
    .pill.active {
      color: #0d5b41;
      background: var(--reward-soft);
    }

    .pill.penalty {
      color: #8b261f;
      background: var(--penalty-soft);
    }

    .pill.post {
      color: #6b440c;
      background: var(--post-soft);
    }

    .pill.diag,
    .pill.derived {
      color: #233f78;
      background: var(--diag-soft);
    }

    .pill.disabled,
    .pill.imitation {
      color: #535d70;
      background: var(--disabled-soft);
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .stat-card {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 10px;
      background: #fbfcff;
    }

    .stat-number {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .stat-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 3px;
    }

    .note-list {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .note-list li {
      margin: 5px 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1120px) {
      .layout,
      .formula-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .cards {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      header,
      main {
        padding-left: 14px;
        padding-right: 14px;
      }

      .section {
        padding: 14px;
      }

      .cards {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      th:nth-child(4),
      td:nth-child(4),
      th:nth-child(7),
      td:nth-child(7) {
        display: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Reward ex_novo - baseline MLP</h1>
    <p class="subhead">
      Mappa grafica della reward usata da <code>RewardShapingWrapper</code> in modalita <code>ex_novo</code>.
      La parte positiva viene composta prima del clipping; safety, contatto, range e vincoli ex-novo restano post-clipping.
    </p>
    <div class="badges" aria-label="sorgenti analizzate">
      <span class="badge">Config: training_exnovo_cfg.yaml</span>
      <span class="badge">Formula: reward_function.py::compute_reward</span>
      <span class="badge">Termini env: osim_trj_cmc_like.py::_get_reward</span>
      <span class="badge">Wrapper: RewardShapingWrapper</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="section">
      <h2>Formula ex_novo</h2>
      <div class="formula-grid">
        <div class="formula">
          <h3>Pre-clipping</h3>
          <code>positive_preclip =
  0.20 * tracking_score
+ 0.00 * reference_score
+ 0.00 * bio_score
+ 0.35 * contact_load_score
+ 0.25 * phase_regular_score
- penalty

reward_base = clip(positive_preclip, 0.0, 1.0)</code>
        </div>
        <div class="formula">
          <h3>Post-clipping</h3>
          <code>reward =
  reward_base
- safety_term
- grf_penetration_term
- grf_ankle_moment_flip_term
- phase_timeout_penalty_term
- exnovo_task_term
- prosthetic_joint_range_term
- morphology_term
- oob_term</code>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="legend">
        <span class="chip reward">Reward / score positivo</span>
        <span class="chip penalty">Penalty pre-clip</span>
        <span class="chip post">Penalty post-clip</span>
        <span class="chip diag">Derivato / diagnostico</span>
        <span class="chip disabled">Peso zero o solo imitation</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Flusso grafico</h2>
      <div id="flow" class="flow" aria-label="diagramma del flusso reward">
        <div class="flow-lane">
          <div class="flow-title">Sorgenti</div>
          <span class="chip diag">env reward_terms</span>
          <span class="chip diag">wrapper task terms</span>
          <span class="chip diag">policy_segment_values</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-lane">
          <div class="flow-title">Score positivi pre-clip</div>
          <span class="chip reward">tracking_score * 0.20</span>
          <span class="chip reward">contact_load_score * 0.35</span>
          <span class="chip reward">phase_regular_score * 0.25</span>
          <span class="chip disabled">reference_score * 0.00</span>
          <span class="chip disabled">bio_score * 0.00</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-lane">
          <div class="flow-title">Penalty pre-clip</div>
          <span class="chip penalty">effort + smoothness + saturation</span>
          <span class="chip penalty">command_rate aggregate</span>
          <span class="chip penalty">SEA usability terms</span>
          <span class="chip disabled">optional direct command terms</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-lane">
          <div class="flow-title">Clip</div>
          <span class="chip diag">reward_base = clip(pre, 0, 1)</span>
          <span class="chip diag">pre-clip reward cannot go below 0</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-lane">
          <div class="flow-title">Penalty post-clip</div>
          <span class="chip post">safety + GRF feasibility</span>
          <span class="chip post">phase timeout guard</span>
          <span class="chip post">swing/load/slip task</span>
          <span class="chip post">q range + oob</span>
          <span class="chip disabled">morphology weight 0</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-lane">
          <div class="flow-title">Output</div>
          <span class="chip reward">reward</span>
          <span class="chip diag">reward_components</span>
          <span class="chip diag">reward_terms</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="layout">
      <section class="section">
        <h2>Catalogo termini</h2>
        <div class="cards" id="summaryCards" aria-label="conteggio termini"></div>
        <div class="filters" aria-label="filtri catalogo">
          <input id="searchBox" type="search" placeholder="Cerca termine, formula, gruppo o nota">
          <select id="stageFilter" aria-label="filtra per stage">
            <option value="">Tutti gli stage</option>
          </select>
          <select id="statusFilter" aria-label="filtra per stato">
            <option value="">Tutti gli stati</option>
          </select>
          <select id="groupFilter" aria-label="filtra per gruppo">
            <option value="">Tutti i gruppi</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <table aria-label="tutti i termini reward">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Termine</th>
              <th>Ruolo</th>
              <th>Stage</th>
              <th>Stato</th>
              <th>Peso / blend</th>
              <th>Origine / formula</th>
              <th>Gruppo</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody id="termRows"></tbody>
        </table>
      </section>

      <aside class="section">
        <h2>Pesi ex_novo</h2>
        <div id="weights" class="weights"></div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Note operative</h2>
      <ul class="note-list">
        <li><code>reference_score</code> e <code>bio_score</code> sono ancora calcolati ma hanno blend 0.0 nella configurazione ex-novo: restano diagnostici/legacy.</li>
        <li><code>phase_timeout_loss</code> entra due volte: dentro <code>phase_regularity_loss</code> per il punteggio pre-clip e come <code>phase_timeout_penalty_term</code> post-clip.</li>
        <li><code>segment_delta_loss</code>, <code>qdot_ref_loss</code>, <code>qddot_ref_loss</code>, <code>jerk_ref_loss</code>, <code>reference_governor_loss</code> e <code>u_rate_loss</code> sono attivi tramite <code>command_rate_loss</code>; i loro pesi diretti sono 0.0.</li>
        <li><code>morphology_loss</code>, <code>reserve_residual_loss</code>, <code>pelvis_height_loss</code> e <code>policy_action_clip_loss</code> sono visualizzati ma non modificano la reward con i pesi attuali.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>

